    "body": "The scale readback was misleading because the setter ran before the lantern object had its physics skeleton. It could report 0.25 while the visible object stayed full size.\n\nThe setter and its readback now run after skeleton creation, both at spawn and after a setting change. After the next install, test 0.25 and 2.0. The lantern must visibly resize and keep the selected size.",
